  <strong><p>Celebrating 75<sup>th</sup> Year</p></strong>

  <h2>Our mission</h2>
  <p>
    San Joaquin Valley Town Hall is a non-profit organization that is run by an all-volunteer board 
    of directors. Our mission is to bring nationally and internationally renowned,
    thought-provoking speakers who inform, educate, and entertain our audience!
    As one or our members told us:
  </p>
  <blockquote>
    "Each year I give a ticket package to each of our family members.
     I think of it as the gift of knowledge...and that is priceless"
      </p>
  </blockquote>
  <h2>Our Ticket Packages</h2>
  <ul>
      <li>Season Ticket: $95</li>
